---
import siteConfig from '../data/site-config';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ContentsNav from '../components/ContentsNav.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description={siteConfig.description} showNav={false}>
    <div class="mt-6 grid gap-8 sm:mt-10 sm:grid-cols-[1.6fr_1fr] sm:gap-10">
        <div class="text-ink space-y-5 text-[19px] leading-[1.75]">
            <p>Hi, I'm Serene. I am more than my career pivots and hobbies. I live heart-forward, <span class="text-clay font-medium italic">chasing fireflies and feeling alive.</span></p>
            <p>I grew up in New Mexico, spent nearly two decades in Seattle, and now live in Philadelphia. I spend my time walking my neighborhood vibrant with history and mosaics. I am also slowly convincing a concrete backyard that it's a garden. I am building community and nurturing friendships.</p>
            <p>On weekends I dream of mucking stalls for rescued livestock serving the theory that a farm should be earned before it's owned. I see llamas and guardian dogs and horses when I sleep, when I dream.</p>
            <p>This site isn't a portfolio site, because resumes are boring and I am more interesting than my college degrees. This site keeps track of what I'm <a class="text-teal border-teal-underline hover:border-teal border-b" href="/now">reading, making, and growing</a>.</p>
        </div>
        <ContentsNav />
    </div>
</BaseLayout>
